#20300
The Eastern Approach~
   The fens give way to a wide grey plain under a low sky. The ground is
littered with the leavings of an army: a broken wheel, a helmet, a boot, a
standard pole snapped in half. Ahead, as far as you can see, the plain is
covered with the dead, and some of them are standing up.
~
