#20301
The Ruined Encampment~
   The army's camp stood here on the morning of the battle. The tents are
slashed and trampled, the cookfires cold for a year, and the camp followers'
wagons burned where they stood. Pots still hang over the dead fires, crusted
with porridge nobody finished.
