#20302
The Command Tent~
   The great tent of the army's commanders still stands, its canvas torn and
its poles leaning. A map table holds a plan of the battle, the pieces
knocked over. A ghostly officer bends over it, moving the pieces, again and
again, trying to find the order that would have won.
~
