#20303
The Field Hospital~
   Rows of cots stand under a collapsed awning, and on each cot lies a
soldier who died waiting for a surgeon. They are sitting up now, holding
their wounds closed, waiting still. A surgeon's ghost moves among them with
a saw, unable to save any of them, unable to stop trying.
~
