#20304
The Centre of the Field~
   The heart of the battle, where the five companies of the centre broke.
The ground is churned and black, and the dead lie three deep. Many of them
are moving, re-forming their ranks, lifting broken spears. They advance
toward you in silence, as they once advanced toward the West.
~
