#20308
The Wrecked Siege Line~
   A line of great trebuchets the army dragged here to break the West's
lines. They were never fired. Something tore them apart, splintering beams
as thick as trees. The crews lie beneath the wreckage, and one of the
engines has been rebuilt by dead hands, out of timber and bone.
