#20314
The Bone Pyre~
   At the western edge of the battlefield the servants of Nu'Groth have
built a pyre of bones as tall as a tower. It burns with a cold grey flame
that gives no heat. Dead men file past it in a slow column, and as each
passes, the grey fire leaps into its empty eyes.
~
